These are the modified versions of the PCBs from OpenPMU. A brief overview of the changes:
- The sensor part has been adapted to 230V and 16A at 50Hz.
- The communication between sensor and measurement computer is digital now. All analog related circuitry is now on the Sensor Board only.
- The power and communication lines between the sensor board and the sensor cape has been secured with an isolation transformer and optocouplers.

The original OpenPMU project can be found here: https://www.openpmu.org/

It is highly recommended that this project is constructed and operated exclusively by qualified personnel!
